<table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">May 29, 2004 :: Should have Lois Layne reporting!</div><p>Headed down to the Hole to get Nortlav for Kasserole's red scale, grats Kass on that! Guardian of the Seal was up so decided to kill him and his guards.. Lumalie saved the Ghostly Mantle of the Dead from rotting and Neclore did the same for the Purified Steel Earring. </p><p>Back to the towers for some loots.. Grats Kulvard on your Wand of the Ice Storm, Neclore on your Mantle of the Rainmaker, Garetjax on the Great Blade of Storms and Kasserole got the Ornate Leather Tunic pattern. Only highlight here was Kass tanking the plate guy and falling through the wall... ending up .. somewhere with a pack of giants. He somewhat slowly died, thanks to being defensive. At low health plate guy summoned him back for another visit and killed him. Lucky for us we had bards! A few seconds after his death I think a whole wing of giants popped on us. Clearly the train is the fault of the bards.. NOT Kass. Our warrior is just trying to get credit for it. Even has an <a href="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/kassandra/towerraid.jpg">artist's rendering </a>of it I'll link. </p><p>Grats Amplexus on getting your Coldain Shawl of Goodness finished up! And for not getting your epic! I'm sure they'll fix that soon. </p><p>Some epics were completed. I'll have to have someone else take pictures and add them or something. </p><p>Grats Kasserole on finally finishing your warrior epic, you bum!<br />Grats Vayln on completing Swiftwind!<br /><img alt="Vayln's Swiftwind!" src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/vayln.jpg" align="baseline" /><br />Grats Kyriath on completing Staff of the Four!</p><p>I found an old sheet with levels in it.. some of these are very old news and some may not be new at all, but will add them all regardless!<br />Grats Corseil on 65 and Coercer!<br />Grats Iionz on 65 and Deceiver!<br />Grats Zorin on 64!<br />Grats Thunderstorms, Thrakish, Tessi, Lumalie and Kelrye on 63!<br />Grats Hedonista on 62!<br />Grats Ewlala on 61! <br />Grats Bishup on 60 and Warlord!<br />Grats Milora and Gizella on 60 and Heirophant!<br />Grats Khuul on 60 and Savage Lord!<br />Grats Lyllian and Shatta on 59!<br />Grats Poyndexter and Reili on 57!<br />Grats Nuich and Kyriath on 56!<br />Grats Calidan on 55 and Knight!<br />Grats Amplexus on 53!<br />Grats Vayln on 51 and Pathfinder!<br />Grats Puven on 50!<br />Grats Tebo, Nibsim and Darkreligon on 49!<br /></p><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on May 30, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">May 8, 2004 :: More quickie updates!</div><P>Happy Mother's Day to the moms out there! </P>
<P>Grats Tessi on your Water Sprinkler of Nem Ankh! I haven't taken pics because I'm bad =/</P>
<P>Grats Tebo on 46 and starting your epic! That Dagnor's dragon is fun fun!</P>
<P>Garacaius had some folks down in Tactics killing Glykus the Pig Lover, and all his little piggies too! Grats Garetjax on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/splitbladeofdestruction.jpe">Split Blade of Destruction</A>! </P>
<P>Other random grats to Lairiel and his Great Blade of Storms, Thrakish and Ashpaw on your Tunics of the Khati Sha, Amplexus on a Primal Cudgel, Nibsim on Strands of Power, Wonderbuns saved a Robe from rot, someone else got a Belt too. </P>
<P>Killed some of those named giants in Storms and got more folks keyed up for BoT... way too late at night!</P>
<P>Leveling grats! Disclaimer: I had even made a nice list.. but in my cleaning frenzy I threw it out. <BR>Grats Iionz on 63! <BR>Grats Shatta on 58!<BR>Grats Tebo on 46! (even though I said that already..)<BR>Grats all those people on my list that I threw out!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Apr 28, 2004 :: I'm sooo lazy!</div><P>Well, I don't have the level updates, so I'll have to add those once the game is back up. </P>
<P>We killed&nbsp;the Velious Kings again. Grats me on some head to get my <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/whitedragonscaleboots.jpg">White Dragonscale Boots</A>, Tankorr on the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6139">Crown of the Kromzek Kings</A>, Garetjax on the shard and he also saved the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics17/AxeoftheKromzekKings.gif">Axe of the Kromzek Kings</A> from rotting, and Tempys won the greed roll on the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/WristGuardofThunder.JPG">Wrist Guard of Thunder</A> ... so grats Baxis! Grats Kasserole on some head to make <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/gauntletsodslaying.jpg">Gauntlets of Dragon Slaying</A>, Arglar on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/yelinaks_talisman.JPG">Yelinak's Talisman</A>, and Kelnya on the greed roll for&nbsp;<A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/very_large_coin_purse.JPG">A Very Large Coin Purse</A> ... some other stuff went to greed and rot too. &nbsp;Grellk and Colwn got some head to make their <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/belt_dwarfslaying.JPG">Belt of Dwarf Slaying</A>, Poyndexter saved the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=4687">Frostreaver</A> from rot, Ahyth saved <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/frostreavers_velium_crown.jpg">Frostreaver's Velium Crown</A> for some resists, and Jakr won the greed roll on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/frostreavers_embroidered_cloak.jpg">Frostreaver's Embroidered Cloak</A>! I forgot who got the other stuff,&nbsp;but it was all rot&nbsp;or greed as well. &nbsp;As a side note... when are they going to let the Dain have limbs again. I'm getting tired of killing a torso.. it's kind of alarming. </P>
<P>Nuich got his epic somewhere in there, and I think I forgot to mention it.. grats on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/dfpics/ragebringer.gif">Ragebringer</A>!! And Brytelyte got his <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/blessed_coldain_prayer_shawl.jpg">shawl</A> done as well! </P>
<P>And grats Thayet and Schena on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics18/sage_headdress_consciousness.jpg">new hats</A>, Nibsim on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics17/bile_stained_robe.jpg">new robe</A>, and Vaea on saving a robe from rotting as well! </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Apr 28, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Apr 16, 2004 :: The shakes.. make them stop..</div><P>So, it came to our attention that Wonderous was having withdrawels from lack of click rezzing people.&nbsp; Wonderous has a condition, that is very unhealthy and probably needs to see a shrink for.&nbsp; It's much like a crack addict not hitting the pipe for a day.&nbsp; Anyway, on with the update..</P>
<P>Auliffe Chaoswind donated loot to Capulus last night.&nbsp; I logged in at the tail end of this, but I hear it was a valiant fight.</P>
<P>Grats Ccra on an Ornate Leather Tunic pattern.<BR>Grats&nbsp;Mahrsan on a Greatstaff of the Four Winds.&nbsp; </P>
<P>Grats to Brytelyte on an Ornate Silk Bracelet pattern that dropped on the way up as well.</P>
<P>Next we went to the Lightning Tower.&nbsp; I hate this tower.&nbsp; Why? you ask, because I can not use my precious Strike Of Solusek in this tower.&nbsp; You see, SoE decided to make them fire immune.&nbsp; I hate them.&nbsp; They give me this glorious spell and then not allow me to use it on everything.&nbsp; </P>
<P>We start moving up the tower and Wonderous logs in, shaking uncontrolably because she hasn't clicked anything in quite some time.&nbsp; Wonderous runs like the wind in her gold Harlot boots and manages to catch the raid before repops occured.&nbsp; Low and behold, as if an act of God, or Buddha, whichever you prefer, Mahrsan died on a pull.&nbsp; I informed Wonderous of this and in return I see, "WHERE IS THE DAMN BODY??!!!"&nbsp; She clicks Mahrsan and the shakes subside a bit.&nbsp; </P>
<P>On with the story, monks keep bringing us mobs, like they are cattle being brought to the slaughter.&nbsp; Well somehow Brynju decided to join the 2 that were incoming and we had no notice of this.&nbsp; Things didn't go too well with that and the would be heroine, Wonderous was slain with 5 seconds left to camp.&nbsp; </P>
<P>In Capulus, we have this thing called Frog Power.&nbsp; Grellk, Bukowski and myself all possess this fine ability.&nbsp; Grellk goes back to BoT and makes a mad dash through the repops and gets to our corpses and rezzes in a cleric.&nbsp; Bless you Grellk, you made frogs everywhere proud last night.&nbsp; Wonderous then gets clicked in and goes on a mad clicking spree.&nbsp; When I was rezzed in, I saw a new particle effect on Wonderous' clicker.&nbsp; There was smoke coming out of the ass end of it.&nbsp; Wonderous was standing there in an orgasmic stance.&nbsp; The shakes had stopped....</P>
<P>Rebuffed and full of vengence, the monks brought us more cattle to slaughter.&nbsp; Then they brought us Brynju, alone and we were expecting him.&nbsp; Brynju got his ass handed to him in a very glorious fashion.&nbsp; It wasn't the first time &amp; it damn sure won't be the last time, but there is always something so damn satisfying about laying waste to a mob that just wiped you.&nbsp; </P>
<P>Grats Kaminastef on Glowing Orb of the Stormwatcher.&nbsp; <BR>Grats to Ashzeriam's alt shammy on an Ornate Chain Tunic pattern.</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Lokki<br> :: Last edited by Lokki on Apr 16, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Apr 14, 2004 :: And the Leveling keeps going!</div><P>Its been a relaxing and quiet time the past few weeks. We've had&nbsp;a ton of folks level recently and a few of us just got back from Fanfaire! (ok it was a while ago :P)</P>
<P>Congratulations go out to ..<BR>... crap EverQuest just crashed.. one moment ...</P>
<P>New Members :<BR>... Lopingwolf<BR>... Traver<BR>... Poyndexter</P>
<P>New Levels :<BR>... Schena at 65th!<BR>... Druentia wanna-be Mabh at 65th!<BR>... Iionz at 62nd (omg!)<BR>... Thrakish at 60th! Feels good to be over the hill doesn't it?<BR>... Dawneylee at 58th! (.. how did that happen Moor.. I paid you well)<BR>... and last but not least Thunnus at 58th! Time for some LDoN baby!</P>
<P>Expect some more lively news in the near future.. lots of great and exciting things are coming.. oh .. wrong line.. its Summer.. expect cool breezy nights and our members living outside for the coming months ;)</P>
<P>- Wonderous</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Wonderous</p></td></tr></table><p /><span class="page-scroll">Pages:  1 <a href='news.asp?page=2'>2</a> <a href='news.asp?page=3'>3</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=14'>14</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=2'>&raquo;</a></span></td>
			<td class="panel-cell"><!-- Right Panel Cell -->
				<div class="headlines">
<a href=news.asp?newsid=612><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/althumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 29</b></a> - Flawless Victory!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=611><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/adthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 28</b></a> - Aerin'Dar, dragon o' pally loot!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=605><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/grummthumb.gif border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 1</b></a> - I'm bigger than you.. I'm higher on the food chain!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=602><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/littleterry.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Jan 24</b></a> - Terris Thule Naptime!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=575><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/dainthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 22</b></a> - Dain Frostreaver's Feet!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=563><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/yelinak.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 8</b></a> - Lord Yelinak!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=562><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/stthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 7</b></a> - Visit to Sleeper's Tomb<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=560><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/tormaxthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 5</b></a> - The King is Dead!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=547><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/vpthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 26</b></a> - Veeshan's Peak cleared!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=543><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/narandithumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 21</b></a> - Mahrsan gets his 10th Ring, and we get to have a war!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=542><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/lendthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 18</b></a> - Keep this, beotch! And Sont too..<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=524><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/zlandthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 3</b></a> - Zland and Kland go down... naughty..<p>
